Package: cymbra-music
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: NEETROF <contact@cymbra.app>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libasound2 | libasound2t64, libsecret-1-0, pkexec | policykit-1, apt
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://cymbra.app/music
Description: Learn and practise music with your MIDI instrument
 Cymbra Music follows the score in real time while you play a MIDI keyboard
 or electronic drum kit, with immediate feedback and step-by-step lessons.
 .
 Updates are offered inside the app and installed after you confirm with your
 password.
